<title>USA: Northrop Grumman gets $490 mln USAF deal.</title>
<headline>Northrop Grumman gets $490 mln USAF deal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northrop Grumman Corp has been awarded a $490 million U.S. defense contract for a multi-stage improvement program on the B-2 stealth bomber fleet, the Air Force said.</p>
<p>The previously-planned program will include various enhancements and equipment upgrades on the radar-avoiding U.S. bombers. Work is expected to be completed by mid-2002 and funding will be obligated as individual delivery orders are issued, the Air Force said.</p>
</text>
